{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Edit Mode Automation.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Edit Mode Automation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender edit mode automation blender edit mode automation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Edit Mode Automation.md","fileName":"Blender Edit Mode Automation.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Edit Mode Automation","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-08 09:04\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Procedural Mesh Editing with bmesh]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Procedural Mesh Editing with bmesh","blenderpythonapi.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Edit Mode Automation.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Edit Mode Automation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender edit mode automation blender edit mode automation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Edit Mode Automation.md","fileName":"Blender Edit Mode Automation.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Edit Mode Automation","heading":"Blender Edit Mode Automation","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Object Mode operations treat a mesh object as a whole, while Edit Mode exposes its vertices, edges, and faces. Granular procedural modeling therefore requires a script to enter Edit Mode, establish a component selection, perform mesh operations, and return to a safe mode when object-level work resumes.\n\nMode is part of Blender's context, not merely a visual preference. An operator that succeeds in Object Mode may be invalid in Edit Mode, and `bmesh.from_edit_mesh` expects editable mesh data. Wrapper functions that set mode and clear stale selections make later modeling steps more predictable.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Procedural Mesh Editing with bmesh","blenderpythonapi.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Edit Mode Automation.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Edit Mode Automation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender edit mode automation blender edit mode automation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Edit Mode Automation.md","fileName":"Blender Edit Mode Automation.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Edit Mode Automation","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[blenderpythonapi.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Procedural Mesh Editing with bmesh","blenderpythonapi.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}